{"id":"9a02fd87820572ba","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-cat-comonad.md","title":"ZFC Cat Comonad","display":"df-zfc-cat-comonad — ZFC Cat Comonad","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-comonad","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-comonad"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-comonad — ZFC Cat Comonad","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-comonad"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-comonad</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-comonad — ZFC Cat Comonad"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (category)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(T:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> (endofunctor candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon:T\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\epsilon:T\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> (counit candidate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta:T\\Rightarrow T\\circ T\">\\(\\delta:T\\Rightarrow T\\circ T\\)</span> (comultiplication candidate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\)</span> (natural-transformation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comonad}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comonad}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}comonad} \\vdash \\operatorname{Comonad}(T,\\epsilon,\\delta,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\epsilon,T,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\delta,T,T\\circ T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(T(\\delta_X)\\circ\\delta_X=\\delta_{T(X)}\\circ\\delta_X\\land T(\\epsilon_X)\\circ\\delta_X=\\operatorname{id}_{T(X)}\\land\\epsilon_{T(X)}\\circ\\delta_X=\\operatorname{id}_{T(X)}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}comonad} \\vdash \\operatorname{Comonad}(T,\\epsilon,\\delta,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\epsilon,T,\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal C},\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\delta,T,T\\circ T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl(T(\\delta_X)\\circ\\delta_X=\\delta_{T(X)}\\circ\\delta_X\\land T(\\epsilon_X)\\circ\\delta_X=\\operatorname{id}_{T(X)}\\land\\epsilon_{T(X)}\\circ\\delta_X=\\operatorname{id}_{T(X)}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The three final equations are coassociativity and the two counit laws.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\epsilon:T\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal C}$ (counit candidate, see [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\delta:T\\Rightarrow T\\circ T$ (comultiplication candidate, see [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S$ (category predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}_S$ (functor predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","i